        },
        {
          n: '2',
          title: 'Um sistema ou aplicativo com login',
          sub: 'Tem painel, dados, cada um vê o seu (tipo um SaaS).',
          stack: 'React + Vite',
          reason: 'App interativo e rápido de construir, ideal pra painéis e telas com login.',
        },
        {
          n: '3',
          title: 'Uma loja que precisa aparecer no Google',
          sub: 'Alguém pesquisa e encontra as suas páginas.',
          stack: 'Next.js',
          reason: 'Aparece nas buscas e aguenta loja com muita página, sem abrir mão de velocidade.',
        },
      ],
      resultLabel: 'A SKILL ESCOLHE POR VOCÊ',
      resultHint: 'Você não escolhe a tecnologia. Você descreve o que quer, a skill faz o resto.',
      termLine: 'projeto criado, pronto pra rodar',
    },
    how: {
      kicker: 'COMO FUNCIONA',
      hA: 'São só ',
      hEm: '2 passos',
      hB: '',
      p: 'Uma vez pra instalar, e depois é só chamar dentro do Claude Code.',
      s1cap: 'ETAPA 1 · UMA VEZ SÓ',
      s1title: 'Instale a skill',
      s1body: 'Cole esse comando no terminal. Ele baixa a skill e deixa disponível em todos os seus projetos.',
      s2cap: 'ETAPA 2 · SEMPRE QUE COMEÇAR',
      s2title: 'Chame o /start',
      s2body: 'Numa pasta vazia, digite /start no Claude Code. Ele faz as perguntas e monta tudo com você.',
      welcome: 'Bem-vindo ao Claude Code',
    },
    ways: {
      kicker: 'DUAS FORMAS',
      hA: 'Por ',
      hEm: 'comando',
      hB: ' ou pelo Carcará',
      p: 'A mesma skill, do jeito que combina com você.',
      now: 'DISPONÍVEL AGORA',
      inApp: 'NO CARCARÁ',
      cardA: {
        title: 'Pelo comando /start',
        body: 'Roda npx start-skill uma vez, depois é só /start em qualquer projeto. Funciona em qualquer Claude Code.',
      },
      cardB: {
        title: 'Dentro do Carcará',
        body: 'A mesma skill vira botão: você clica nos quadradinhos, responde as perguntas e o Carcará monta o projeto pra você, sem sair do app.',
      },
    },
    does: {
      kicker: 'O QUE ELA FAZ',
      hA: 'Mais que criar ',
      hEm: 'pastas',
      hB: '',
      p: 'Ela não solta um HTML cru e some. Ela deixa a base pronta e blindada.',
      items: [
        {
          title: 'Cria o projeto de verdade',
          body: 'Scaffold completo com a stack certa, não um index.html com CSS cru. Uma página inicial bonita já no lugar.',
        },
        {
          title: 'Suas senhas nunca vazam',
          body: 'Já cria .gitignore e .env/.env.example prontos. O segredo real nunca vai pro Git, no automático.',
        },
        {
          title: 'Já vem blindado',
          body: 'Instala as skills de banco (Supabase), de visual (frontend-design) e de debug automático que te protegem de você mesmo.',
        },
        {
          title: 'Um CLAUDE.md que te cuida',
          body: 'Deixa instruções pro Claude consultar a skill certa antes de mexer em banco ou visual, e debugar sozinho quando dá erro.',
        },
        {
          title: 'Coloca no ar com você',
          body: 'Quando você quiser publicar, ela guia o deploy no Cloudflare Pages em passos simples, sem jargão.',
        },
      ],
    },
    cta: {
      kicker: 'BORA COMEÇAR',
      hA: 'Em ',
      hEm: '3 minutos',
      hB: ', você começou',
      lead: 'É só colar esse comando. O resto você resolve conversando, em português.',
      copy: 'Copiar comando',
      copied: 'Copiado!',
      note: 'Precisa do Git instalado. Funciona no Windows, Mac e Linux.',
      back: 'Conhecer o Carcará Code',
    },
  },
  en: {
    meta: {
      title: 'How to start a project in Claude Code · Carcará Code',
      description:
        "Don't know which tech to use? The start skill asks up to 3 simple questions and scaffolds your project with the right stack already set up. Available by command (npx start-skill) and also inside Carcará.",
    },
    hero: {
      kicker: 'HOW TO START A PROJECT',
      badge: 'start skill',
      titleL1: "Don't know where",
      titleL2: 'to start?',
      sub: "In Lovable it's one click. In Claude Code you freeze at a black screen, unsure which tech to pick. The start skill fixes that: you answer 1 simple question and it scaffolds the project, with the right stack already set up.",
      ctaCopy: 'Copy npx start-skill',
      ctaCopied: 'Copied!',
      ctaSee: 'See how it works',
      tags: ['available by command', 'also in Carcará', 'free and open source'],
    },
    problem: {
      kicker: 'THE PROBLEM',
      hA: 'One click on one side. ',
      hEm: 'On the other,',
      hB: ' you freeze.',
      p: 'It was never that Claude Code is worse. Nobody just tells you where to start.',
      cards: [
        {
          tag: 'LOVABLE',
          title: 'One click',
          body: 'You describe it, it starts. Zero technical decisions in your face.',
          tone: 'ok',
        },
        {
          tag: 'CLAUDE CODE, WITHOUT THE SKILL',
          title: 'A black screen',
          body: 'Astro? React? Next? You freeze on the first choice, and it is far too technical.',
          tone: 'bad',
        },
        {
          tag: 'CLAUDE CODE, WITH THE SKILL',
          title: 'One question',
          body: 'You say what you want in plain words. The skill decides the tech.',
          tone: 'best',
        },
      ],
    },
    picker: {
      kicker: 'ANSWER 1 QUESTION',
      hA: 'What do you ',
      hEm: 'want',
      hB: ' to build?',
      p: 'Click the option that matches your project. The skill decides the tech for you. You never need to know the difference between them.',
      options: [
        {
          n: '1',
          title: 'A sales or landing page',
          sub: 'People land, read and click to buy or reach out.',
          stack: 'Astro',
          reason: 'Fast to load and great for Google, perfect for content pages.',
        },
        {
          n: '2',
          title: 'A system or app with login',
          sub: 'It has a dashboard, data, each person sees their own (like a SaaS).',
          stack: 'React + Vite',
          reason: 'Interactive and quick to build, ideal for dashboards and login screens.',
        },
        {
          n: '3',
          title: 'A store that needs to show up on Google',
          sub: 'Someone searches and finds your pages.',
          stack: 'Next.js',
          reason: 'Shows up in search and handles stores with many pages, without losing speed.',
        },
      ],
      resultLabel: 'THE SKILL PICKS FOR YOU',
      resultHint: 'You do not pick the tech. You describe what you want, the skill does the rest.',
      termLine: 'project created, ready to run',
    },
    how: {
      kicker: 'HOW IT WORKS',
      hA: 'Just ',
      hEm: '2 steps',
      hB: '',
      p: 'Once to install, then just call it inside Claude Code.',
      s1cap: 'STEP 1 · ONCE',
      s1title: 'Install the skill',
      s1body: 'Paste this in your terminal. It downloads the skill and makes it available in all your projects.',
      s2cap: 'STEP 2 · EVERY TIME YOU START',
      s2title: 'Call /start',
      s2body: 'In an empty folder, type /start in Claude Code. It asks the questions and builds everything with you.',
      welcome: 'Welcome to Claude Code',
    },
    ways: {
      kicker: 'TWO WAYS',
      hA: 'By ',
      hEm: 'command',
      hB: ' or inside Carcará',
      p: 'The same skill, whichever way suits you.',
      now: 'AVAILABLE NOW',
      inApp: 'IN CARCARÁ',
      cardA: {
        title: 'By the /start command',
        body: 'Run npx start-skill once, then just /start in any project. Works in any Claude Code.',
      },
      cardB: {
        title: 'Inside Carcará',
        body: 'The same skill becomes a button: you click the squares, answer the questions and Carcará builds the project for you, without leaving the app.',
      },
    },
    does: {
      kicker: 'WHAT IT DOES',
      hA: 'More than making ',
      hEm: 'folders',
      hB: '',
      p: 'It does not drop a raw HTML and vanish. It leaves the base ready and hardened.',
      items: [
        {
          title: 'Creates a real project',
          body: 'A full scaffold with the right stack, not an index.html with raw CSS. A nice starting page already in place.',
        },
        {
          title: 'Your secrets never leak',
          body: 'It creates .gitignore and .env/.env.example for you. The real secret never goes to Git, automatically.',
        },
        {
          title: 'Hardened from the start',
          body: 'Installs the database (Supabase), design (frontend-design) and auto-debug skills that protect you from yourself.',
        },
        {
          title: 'A CLAUDE.md that looks after you',
          body: 'Leaves instructions for Claude to consult the right skill before touching database or design, and to debug on its own when something breaks.',
        },
        {
          title: 'Ships it with you',
          body: 'When you want to publish, it guides the Cloudflare Pages deploy in simple steps, no jargon.',
        },
      ],
    },
    cta: {
      kicker: "LET'S START",
      hA: 'In ',
      hEm: '3 minutes',
      hB: ", you've started",
      lead: 'Just paste this command. The rest you sort out by chatting, in plain language.',
      copy: 'Copy command',
      copied: 'Copied!',
      note: 'Requires Git installed. Works on Windows, Mac and Linux.',
      back: 'Discover Carcará Code',
    },
  },
} as const;

const t = isPt ? T.pt : T.en;

// Alternates de idioma desta subpágina (só existe em pt e en).
const pageAlternates = { pt: '/comecar/', en: '/en/comecar/' } as const;

// Ícone de check (traço), mesmo estilo do resto do site.
const CHECK = '<path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/>';
---

<Layout
  lang={lang}
  title={t.meta.title}
  description={t.meta.description}
  pageAlternates={pageAlternates}
>
  <Nav lang={lang} />

  <!-- ===================== HERO (faixa creme) ===================== -->
  <section class="v2band st-hero">
    <div class="v2wrap st-hero-wrap">
      <div class="v2-badge cc-reveal">
        <CarcaraLogo width={14} height={14} />
        <span>{t.hero.badge}</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="st-hero-title cc-reveal">
        <span class="st-hero-l1">{t.hero.titleL1}</span>
        <span class="st-hero-l2">{t.hero.titleL2}</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="st-hero-sub cc-reveal">{t.hero.sub}</p>
      <div class="st-hero-cta cc-reveal">
        <button type="button" class="v2-btn v2-btn--amber st-copy" data-copy="npx start-skill" data-label={t.hero.ctaCopy} data-done={t.hero.ctaCopied}>
          <svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2"/><path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"/></svg>
          <span class="st-copy-txt">{t.hero.ctaCopy}</span>
        </button>
        <a href="#como" class="v2-btn v2-btn--ghost">{t.hero.ctaSee}</a>
      </div>
      <div class="st-hero-tags cc-reveal">
        {t.hero.tags.map((tag) => <span class="st-hero-tag">{tag}</span>)}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===================== O PROBLEMA (faixa escura) ===================== -->
  <section class="v2band v2band--dark">
    <div class="v2wrap">
      <div class="v2sh cc-reveal">
        <div class="v2-kicker">{t.problem.kicker}</div>
        <h2>{t.problem.hA}<span class="v2-em">{t.problem.hEm}</span>{t.problem.hB}</h2>
        <p>{t.problem.p}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="st-prob">
        {t.problem.cards.map((c) => (
          <div class={`st-prob-card st-prob-card--${c.tone} cc-reveal`}>
            <span class="st-prob-tag">{c.tag}</span>
            <span class="st-prob-title">{c.title}</span>
            <p>{c.body}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===================== QUADRADINHOS (faixa papel) ===================== -->
  <section class="v2band v2band--paper" id="responder">
    <div class="v2wrap">
      <div class="v2sh cc-reveal">
        <div class="v2-kicker">{t.picker.kicker}</div>
        <h2>{t.picker.hA}<span class="v2-em">{t.picker.hEm}</span>{t.picker.hB}</h2>
        <p>{t.picker.p}</p>
      </div>

      <div class="st-picker cc-reveal" data-picker>
        <div class="st-opts" role="listbox" aria-label={t.picker.hA + t.picker.hEm + t.picker.hB}>
          {t.picker.options.map((o, i) => (
            <button
              type="button"
              class="st-opt"
              role="option"
              data-opt
              data-stack={o.stack}
              data-reason={o.reason}
              data-active={i === 0 ? '' : undefined}
              aria-selected={i === 0 ? 'true' : 'false'}
            >
              <span class="st-opt-n">{o.n}</span>
              <span class="st-opt-body">
                <span class="st-opt-t">{o.title}</span>
                <span class="st-opt-s">{o.sub}</span>
              </span>
              <span class="st-opt-tick" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" set:html={CHECK} />
              </span>
            </button>
          ))}
        </div>

        <div class="st-result" data-result>
          <div class="st-result-label">{t.picker.resultLabel}</div>
          <div class="st-result-stack" data-r-stack>{t.picker.options[0].stack}</div>
          <p class="st-result-reason" data-r-reason>{t.picker.options[0].reason}</p>
          <div class="st-result-term">
            <span class="st-result-term-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
            <code><span class="st-term-prompt">&rsaquo;</span> <span class="st-term-slash">/start</span></code>
            <code class="st-term-ok">
              <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" set:html={CHECK} />
              {t.picker.termLine}
            </code>
          </div>
          <p class="st-result-hint">{t.picker.resultHint}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===================== COMO FUNCIONA / 2 passos (faixa creme) ===================== -->
  <section class="v2band" id="como">
    <div class="v2wrap">
      <div class="v2sh cc-reveal">
        <div class="v2-kicker">{t.how.kicker}</div>
        <h2>{t.how.hA}<span class="v2-em">{t.how.hEm}</span>{t.how.hB}</h2>
        <p>{t.how.p}</p>
      </div>

      <div class="st-steps">
        <div class="st-step cc-reveal">
          <div class="st-step-head">
            <span class="st-step-n">1</span>
            <span class="st-step-cap">{t.how.s1cap}</span>
          </div>
          <h3>{t.how.s1title}</h3>
          <p>{t.how.s1body}</p>
          <div class="st-term st-term--ps">
            <span class="st-term-bar">
              <span class="st-term-tab"><span class="st-ps-ic">&gt;_</span> PowerShell</span>
              <span class="st-win"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
            </span>
            <code><span class="st-ps-prompt">PS&gt;</span> <span class="st-ps-cmd">npx start-skill</span><span class="st-caret"></span></code>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="st-step cc-reveal">
          <div class="st-step-head">
            <span class="st-step-n">2</span>
            <span class="st-step-cap">{t.how.s2cap}</span>
          </div>
          <h3>{t.how.s2title}</h3>
          <p>{t.how.s2body}</p>
          <div class="st-term st-term--cc">
            <span class="st-term-bar">
              <span class="st-term-tab"><CarcaraLogo width={15} height={15} /> Claude Code</span>
              <span class="st-win"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
            </span>
            <code class="st-cc-welcome">✻ {t.how.welcome}</code>
            <code><span class="st-term-prompt">&rsaquo;</span> <span class="st-term-slash">/start</span><span class="st-caret"></span></code>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===================== DUAS FORMAS (faixa papel) ===================== -->
  <section class="v2band v2band--paper">
    <div class="v2wrap">
      <div class="v2sh cc-reveal">
        <div class="v2-kicker">{t.ways.kicker}</div>
        <h2>{t.ways.hA}<span class="v2-em">{t.ways.hEm}</span>{t.ways.hB}</h2>
        <p>{t.ways.p}</p>
      </div>

      <div class="st-ways">
        <div class="st-way cc-reveal">
          <span class="st-way-badge st-way-badge--now"><i></i>{t.ways.now}</span>
          <div class="st-way-ic">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="4 17 10 11 4 5"/><line x1="12" y1="19" x2="20" y2="19"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>{t.ways.cardA.title}</h3>
          <p>{t.ways.cardA.body}</p>
          <code class="st-way-code">npx start-skill</code>
        </div>

        <div class="st-way st-way--soon cc-reveal">
          <span class="st-way-badge st-way-badge--now"><i></i>{t.ways.inApp}</span>
          <div class="st-way-ic st-way-ic--carcara">
            <CarcaraLogo width={24} height={24} fill="#211C15" />
          </div>
          <h3>{t.ways.cardB.title}</h3>
          <p>{t.ways.cardB.body}</p>
          <div class="st-way-squares" aria-hidden="true">
            <span></span><span></span><span></span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===================== O QUE ELA FAZ (faixa escura) ===================== -->
  <section class="v2band v2band--dark">
    <div class="v2wrap">
      <div class="v2sh cc-reveal">
        <div class="v2-kicker">{t.does.kicker}</div>
        <h2>{t.does.hA}<span class="v2-em">{t.does.hEm}</span>{t.does.hB}</h2>
        <p>{t.does.p}</p>
      </div>

      <div class="st-does">
        {t.does.items.map((it) => (
          <div class="st-does-item cc-reveal">
            <span class="st-does-tick">
              <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" set:html={CHECK} />
            </span>
            <div class="st-does-txt">
              <h3>{it.title}</h3>
              <p>{it.body}</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===================== CTA final (faixa âmbar) ===================== -->
  <section class="v2band v2band--amber">
    <div class="v2wrap v2sh cc-reveal">
      <div class="v2-kicker">{t.cta.kicker}</div>
      <h2>{t.cta.hA}<span class="v2-em">{t.cta.hEm}</span>{t.cta.hB}</h2>
      <p>{t.cta.lead}</p>

      <div class="st-cta-box">
        <code class="st-cta-cmd"><span class="st-cta-dollar">$</span> npx start-skill</code>
        <button type="button" class="st-cta-copy st-copy" data-copy="npx start-skill" data-label={t.cta.copy} data-done={t.cta.copied}>
